0..67 Comment "//! `cancel-base` gives the task protocol for cancellation sources."
68..71 Comment "//!"
72..239 Comment "//! A task sends its note on `Join`. A cancellation clause resumes its scope once. The clause can abandon that scope. The clause cancels an abandoned end for its peer."
240..243 Comment "//!"
244..336 Comment "//! Each cancellation source imports `Cancel`. The checker uses `Join` to type a parent end."
